$DATUM Ethylene reaction of [Pt(COD)(OH)]2(OTf)2 (4): Effect of HOTf on the
yield of acetaldehyde. The following reactions were performed using the
same batch of 4 and the same CD2Cl2. Acetaldehyde yields are reported
with respect to the sum of COD)Pt(Et)(OTf) (6) and [(COD)Pt(Et)(C2H4)]OTf
(7). Yield 100%. 1H NMR spectroscopy (AMX-300) showed broad peaks at δ
9.4 and δ 6.9.
