$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (6S,8R)-6,8-Di[(tert-butyldiphenylsilyl)oxy]nonan-2-one (23). Pyridine
(2.5 μl, 0.031 mmol) was added to a mixture of Pd(OAc)2 (1.8 mg, 0.008
mmol) and toluene (0.8 mL). The ambient atmosphere was replaced with
oxygen, the mixture was heated to 60 °C, and propan-2-ol (160 μL) was
added. After 5 min, a solution of alkene 20 (100 mg, 0.157 mmol) in
propan-2-ol (0.6 mL) was added and the mixture was stirred for 14 h at 60
°C. The mixture was cooled, the solvent was evaporated in vacuo and the
residue was then purified by column chromatography (petrol/ether, 99:1)
to afford the title compound (23) (97 mg, 95%) as a colourless oil. Rf
0.20 (petrol/ether, 9:1); [α]D20 +69.0 (c 1.0, CHCl3); 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 0.86 (3 H, d, J8,9 = 6.0 Hz, C(9)H3), 1.00 and 1.01 (2 × s, 2 ×
9 H, 2 × (CH3)3C-), 1.21-1.50 (4 H, m, C(4)H2 and C(5)H2), 1.55-1.61 and
1.88-1.94 (2 × 1 H, 2 × m, C(7)H2), 2.03 (3 H, s, C(1)H3), 2.12 (2 H, t,
J3,4 = 7.4 Hz, C(3)H2), 3.85-3.91 (1 H, m, H-6), 3.92-3.97 (1 H, m, H-8),
7.31-7.37 (8 H, m), 7.40-7.45 (4 H, m) and 7.61-7.64 (8 H, m, 4 × Ph);
13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 19.0 (C-4), 19.3 and 19.5 ((CH3)3C), 23.6
(C-9), 27.1 and 27.2 ((CH3)3C), 29.8 (C-1), 36.1 (C-5), 43.8 (C-3), 46.3
(C-7), 67.3 (C-8), 70.5 (C-6), 127.5, 127.58, 127.61, 127.64, 129.5 and
129.6 (Ph), 134.4, 134.6 and 134.9 (i-Ph), 135.96 and 136.03 (Ph), 209.0
(C-2); IR (film) νmax/cm-1 3071 (s), 2998 (s), 2857(s), 1716 (s), 1589
(m), 1472 (s), 1427 (s), 1361 (s), 1110 (s), 822 (s), 701 (s); HRMS
(ESI+) m/z calcd. for C41H54NaO3Si2 [MNa+] 673.3504, found 673.3484.
