$DATUM 1-[(2R,3S,6R)-3-hydroxy-6-methyltetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl]propan-2-one
(1). To a solution of 12 (13 mg, 0.08 mmol) in DMF (1.5 mL) and H2O (125
mL) was added PdCl2 (3 mg, 0.016 mmol) and CuCl (8 mg, 0.08 mmol), and
the resulting mixture was stirred at r.t. under an O2 atmosphere, for 1.5
h. To the solution was added brine (3 mL) and the mixture was extracted
with CH2Cl2 (3 × 3 mL). The combined organic phases were dried over
Na2SO4 and the solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure. The residue
was purified by chromatography on silica gel (EtOAc-hexane, 10%). Yield:
13 mg (92%); colourless oil. Rf = 0.66 (EtOAc); [α]D23 +12.50 (c 0.01,
MeOH). IR (NaCl): 3627, 3477, 2943, 2838, 1712, 1602 cm-1. 1H NMR
(CDCl3): δ = 3.50 (m, 1 H, CH-2), 3.41 (m, 1 H, CH-6), 3.21 (m, 1 H,
CH-3), 2.82 (dd, J= 15.3, 4.4 Hz, 1 H, CH2-1'), 2.58 (dd, J= 15.5, 7.5
Hz, 1 H, CH2-1'), 2.17 (s, 3 H, CH3-3'), 2.03 (m, 1 H, OH), 1.65 (m, 1 H,
CH2-4), 1.25 (m, 3 H, CH2-5, CH2-4), 1.08 (d, J= 6.17 Hz, 3 H, CH3-6).
13C NMR (CDCl3): δ = 208.95 (CO), 78.33 (CH-2), 73.55 (CH-3), 70.23
(CH-6), 47.13 (CH2-1'), 32.96 (CH2-5), 32.77 (CH2-4), 31.00 (CH3-3'),
21.19 (CH3-6). MS (EI+): m/z (%) = 156 (28) [M - OH]+, 143 (100), 105
(66). HRMS (EI+): m/z calcd for C9H16O2: 156.0837; found: 156.0841.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM overall yield 4.8% from tri-O-acetyl-D-glucal, Wacker oxidation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A concise, enantioselective synthesis of (+)-decarestrictine L from
tri-O-acetyl-D-glucal
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Zuniga, Andrea; Perez, Manuel; Pazos, Gonzalo; Gomez, Generosa; Fall,
Yagamare
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2010), (14), 2446-2450

